[node name="ControlNotebook" parent="Props" instance=ExtResource("notebook")]
transform = Transform3D(1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0.62, 4.8, -23.05)
title = "CONTROL ROOM LOG"
pages = Array[String](["Day 31. Night shift, control room. At 0300 subject 7 sat up on the table with no pulse. The trace on my screen is still flat and it is still walking about. Doctor Hale said the dose was too high. He said it from inside the lab, so I can't ask him what he meant. Cell 3 held it for nine minutes. Then the bars bent like wire and the containment door came out of the wall. I did what the manual says: sealed the vents, cut the lift, locked this room. I think I was too slow with the vents. The manual has nothing after that page. I checked. There are eleven of them down there now, and every one of them was on the rota.", "Day 36. The water cooler is down to a hand's width. I am rationing the coffee, which is cold and five days old and still the best thing in this room. They gather under the window and look up. I don't think they can see through the glass. I stay behind the desks anyway. Kowalski left his game running on the end monitor. He was losing nine to nothing. I have not had the heart to switch it off, and I am not going to finish it for him. The poster by the cooler still says great job team. Somebody has been taping more paper above it to keep the line going. I think it was me. I stopped when I reached the ceiling.", "Day 40. Voices in the vent this morning, living ones. Mara has four people down in the tunnels. They are going up the service shaft behind the pump room tomorrow night, and she says there is room for one more. That means the corridor, the balcony and the stairs, with the lab standing open below me the whole way. I have a chair leg and a cup. If you are reading this in my chair, I left in a hurry and I am sorry about the mess. Two things before you go. The window is only glass, and it will not hold if they ever learn to climb. And nothing in cell 2 is asking for help, whatever it sounds like. Keep moving up."])

